                            <keyword start="305417/5s" duration="12400/2500s" value="010 yes, boo hoo, this is me, sympathetic, feeling your pain - can i get a high five already?"/>
                            <keyword start="1527209/25s" duration="3900/2500s" value="011 with a wry smile, mackenzie obliges."/>
                            <keyword start="1527248/25s" duration="2900/2500s" value="012 well done. time to enjoy the joys of adulthood."/>
                            <keyword start="1527281/25s" duration="13600/2500s" value="013 working, paying taxes, voting, university..."/>
                            <keyword start="1527417/25s" duration="8300/2500s" value="014 yashvi shifts slightly at the mention of uni. gee mackenzie, way to bring down the vibe. let me enjoy the moment a little."/>
                            <keyword start="1527497/25s" duration="7900/2500s" value="018 enjoy the summer, you know, leave the adulting for next year."/>
                            <keyword start="1528467/25s" duration="145200/2500s" value=" sc2"/>
                            <keyword start="1528467/25s" duration="14000/2500s" value="018 enjoy the summer, you know, leave the adulting for next year."/>
                            <keyword start="1528607/25s" duration="6000/2500s" value="021 (distracted) ya-huh."/>
                            <keyword start="1528667/25s" duration="15300/2500s" value="023 but my plan is basically, get rich on a game show, spend it on a face and neck tattoo."/>
                            <keyword start="305764/5s" duration="10400/2500s" value="024 then live out an angry, bitter existence towards all mankind ‘cause i could never get a job."/>
