                            <keyword start="305417/5s" duration="12400/2500s" value="010 yes, boo hoo, this is me, sympathetic, feeling your pain - can i get a high five already?"/>
                            <keyword start="1527209/25s" duration="3900/2500s" value="011 with a wry smile, mackenzie obliges."/>
                            <keyword start="1527248/25s" duration="2900/2500s" value="012 well done. time to enjoy the joys of adulthood."/>
                            <keyword start="1527281/25s" duration="13600/2500s" value="013 working, paying taxes, voting, university..."/>
                            <keyword start="1527417/25s" duration="8300/2500s" value="014 yashvi shifts slightly at the mention of uni. gee mackenzie, way to bring down the vibe. let me enjoy the moment a little."/>
