                            <keyword start="49117s" duration="455700/2500s" value=" sc 6"/>
                            <keyword start="1229016/25s" duration="6800/2500s" value="104 you got your uni preferences in on time?"/>
                            <keyword start="245816/5s" duration="17000/2500s" value="105 yep - sports science at hawke, nursing at langton. and early childhood at eden hills."/>
                            <keyword start="1229248/25s" duration="12600/2500s" value="106 you’ve never mentioned early childhood in any of our careers sessions before."/>
                            <keyword start="1229361/25s" duration="18000/2500s" value="107 well, you know, it comes pretty easy to me. i spend a lot of time with my cousins. (beat) they’re small. "/>
                            <keyword start="1229542/25s" duration="13000/2500s" value="109 eden hill’s footy team has made the grand final two years running. a heap of aflw players get drafted from there... "/>
                            <keyword start="245933/5s" duration="3900/2500s" value="110  and hawke. and langton."/>
                            <keyword start="1229704/25s" duration="12900/2500s" value="111 yashvi, you can’t pick uni courses based on the hope you get drafted from the footy team while you’re there. "/>
                            <keyword start="1229829/25s" duration="8800/2500s" value="112 so i just give up on my dream then?"/>
                            <keyword start="1229994/25s" duration="17300/2500s" value="113 it’ll be pretty hard to follow any dream when you’re lumped with a massive hecs debt for a course you have no interest in."/>
                            <keyword start="1230159/25s" duration="9900/2500s" value="114 sorry, that was rude."/>
                            <keyword start="1230252/25s" duration="9000/2500s" value="115 we’re all just a little anxious about olivia."/>
                            <keyword start="1230334/25s" duration="14100/2500s" value="116 i wouldn’t stress, miss. liv’ll turn up once she knows enough people have noticed she’s gone."/>
                            <keyword start="1230471/25s" duration="16900/2500s" value="117 i probably shouldn’t tell you this, but finn kelly was on school grounds earlier today."/>
                            <keyword start="1230639/25s" duration="11500/2500s" value="118 and what... you think he’s got something to do with olivia going missing?"/>
                            <keyword start="1230754/25s" duration="9100/2500s" value="119 no, no-one thinks that-- well, maybe her mother. "/>
                            <keyword start="1231242/25s" duration="9600/2500s" value="119 no, no-one thinks that-- well, maybe her mother. "/>
                            <keyword start="1231444/25s" duration="7000/2500s" value="120 finn said olivia ran off after she saw him."/>
                            <keyword start="1231444/25s" duration="7100/2500s" value="120 finn said olivia ran off after she saw him."/>
                            <keyword start="1231509/25s" duration="5600/2500s" value="121 maybe she just got scared then. "/>
                            <keyword start="246303/5s" duration="5400/2500s" value="121 maybe she just got scared then. "/>
                            <keyword start="1231561/25s" duration="12400/2500s" value="122 she’s missed a year twelve exam and her phone’s off. it’s very unlike her. "/>
                            <keyword start="1231562/25s" duration="12300/2500s" value="122 she’s missed a year twelve exam and her phone’s off. it’s very unlike her. "/>
                            <keyword start="1231674/25s" duration="8000/2500s" value="124 you two are friends... has she messaged you by chance?"/>
                            <keyword start="1231681/25s" duration="7700/2500s" value="124 you two are friends... has she messaged you by chance?"/>
                            <keyword start="1231751/25s" duration="7900/2500s" value="125 no, i mean i saw her before the exam but -"/>
                            <keyword start="1231753/25s" duration="7900/2500s" value="125 no, i mean i saw her before the exam but -"/>
                            <keyword start="1231829/25s" duration="6900/2500s" value="126 did she say anything? anything unusual, or strange?"/>
                            <keyword start="246366/5s" duration="6700/2500s" value="126 did she say anything? anything unusual, or strange?"/>
                            <keyword start="1231887/25s" duration="7400/2500s" value="127 you think this could be serious?"/>
                            <keyword start="1231892/25s" duration="6500/2500s" value="127 you think this could be serious?"/>
                            <keyword start="1231957/25s" duration="26900/2500s" value="128 we’re worried about her."/>
                            <keyword start="1231958/25s" duration="26800/2500s" value="128 we’re worried about her."/>
