                            <keyword start="49299s" duration="530100/2500s" value=" sc 6"/>
                            <keyword start="1233372/25s" duration="7300/2500s" value="104 you got your uni preferences in on time?"/>
                            <keyword start="1233441/25s" duration="16900/2500s" value="105 yep - sports science at hawke, nursing at langton. and early childhood at eden hills."/>
                            <keyword start="1233608/25s" duration="11300/2500s" value="106 you’ve never mentioned early childhood in any of our careers sessions before."/>
                            <keyword start="1233719/25s" duration="13200/2500s" value="107 well, you know, it comes pretty easy to me. i spend a lot of time with my cousins. (beat) they’re small. "/>
                            <keyword start="246886/5s" duration="7200/2500s" value="104 you got your uni preferences in on time?"/>
                            <keyword start="1234502/25s" duration="19700/2500s" value="105 yep - sports science at hawke, nursing at langton. and early childhood at eden hills."/>
                            <keyword start="1234693/25s" duration="9900/2500s" value="106 you’ve never mentioned early childhood in any of our careers sessions before."/>
                            <keyword start="1234786/25s" duration="17000/2500s" value="107 well, you know, it comes pretty easy to me. i spend a lot of time with my cousins. (beat) they’re small. "/>
                            <keyword start="49398s" duration="15100/2500s" value="109 eden hill’s footy team has made the grand final two years running. a heap of aflw players get drafted from there... "/>
                            <keyword start="1235098/25s" duration="3800/2500s" value="110  and hawke. and langton."/>
                            <keyword start="1235136/25s" duration="15600/2500s" value="111 yashvi, you can’t pick uni courses based on the hope you get drafted from the footy team while you’re there. "/>
                            <keyword start="1235292/25s" duration="7900/2500s" value="112 so i just give up on my dream then?"/>
                            <keyword start="1235366/25s" duration="8200/2500s" value="113 it’ll be pretty hard to follow any dream when you’re lumped with a massive hecs debt for a course you have no interest in."/>
                            <keyword start="1235862/25s" duration="14300/2500s" value="113 it’ll be pretty hard to follow any dream when you’re lumped with a massive hecs debt for a course you have no interest in."/>
                            <keyword start="1235998/25s" duration="9900/2500s" value="114 sorry, that was rude."/>
                            <keyword start="1236096/25s" duration="10700/2500s" value="115 we’re all just a little anxious about olivia."/>
                            <keyword start="1236201/25s" duration="18500/2500s" value="116 i wouldn’t stress, miss. liv’ll turn up once she knows enough people have noticed she’s gone."/>
                            <keyword start="1236378/25s" duration="16500/2500s" value="117 i probably shouldn’t tell you this, but finn kelly was on school grounds earlier today."/>
                            <keyword start="1236534/25s" duration="13200/2500s" value="118 and what... you think he’s got something to do with olivia going missing?"/>
                            <keyword start="1236666/25s" duration="12300/2500s" value="119 no, no-one thinks that-- well, maybe her mother. "/>
                            <keyword start="1236782/25s" duration="8700/2500s" value="120 finn said olivia ran off after she saw him."/>
                            <keyword start="1236857/25s" duration="6600/2500s" value="121 maybe she just got scared then. "/>
                            <keyword start="1236916/25s" duration="13100/2500s" value="122 she’s missed a year twelve exam and her phone’s off. it’s very unlike her. "/>
                            <keyword start="1237034/25s" duration="4500/2500s" value="123 yashvi shifts, uncomfortable. "/>
                            <keyword start="1237052/25s" duration="5700/2500s" value="124 you two are friends... has she messaged you by chance?"/>
                            <keyword start="1237109/25s" duration="6700/2500s" value="125 no, i mean i saw her before the exam but -"/>
                            <keyword start="1237174/25s" duration="9400/2500s" value="126 did she say anything? anything unusual, or strange?"/>
                            <keyword start="1237268/25s" duration="7000/2500s" value="127 you think this could be serious?"/>
                            <keyword start="1237338/25s" duration="26500/2500s" value="128 we’re worried about her."/>
                            <filter-audio ref="r32" name="RX 7 Voice De-noise"/>
                        </mc-clip>
