                            <keyword start="1246277/25s" duration="7s" value="109 eden hill’s footy team has made the grand final two years running. a heap of aflw players get drafted from there... "/>
                            <keyword start="1246452/25s" duration="6200/2500s" value="110  and hawke. and langton."/>
                            <keyword start="1246507/25s" duration="14500/2500s" value="111 yashvi, you can’t pick uni courses based on the hope you get drafted from the footy team while you’re there. "/>
                            <keyword start="1246647/25s" duration="3s" value="112 so i just give up on my dream then?"/>
                            <keyword start="1246722/25s" duration="14900/2500s" value="113 it’ll be pretty hard to follow any dream when you’re lumped with a massive hecs debt for a course you have no interest in."/>
                            <keyword start="1246863/25s" duration="5200/2500s" value="114 sorry, that was rude."/>
                            <keyword start="249383/5s" duration="12700/2500s" value="115 we’re all just a little anxious about olivia."/>
                            <keyword start="1247036/25s" duration="12100/2500s" value="116 i wouldn’t stress, miss. liv’ll turn up once she knows enough people have noticed she’s gone."/>
                            <keyword start="1247157/25s" duration="16700/2500s" value="117 i probably shouldn’t tell you this, but finn kelly was on school grounds earlier today."/>
                            <keyword start="249464/5s" duration="7s" value="118 and what... you think he’s got something to do with olivia going missing?"/>
                            <keyword start="1247628/25s" duration="7600/2500s" value="120 finn said olivia ran off after she saw him."/>
                            <keyword start="1247698/25s" duration="4800/2500s" value="121 maybe she just got scared then. "/>
                            <keyword start="1247742/25s" duration="13200/2500s" value="122 she’s missed a year twelve exam and her phone’s off. it’s very unlike her. "/>
                            <keyword start="1247866/25s" duration="7900/2500s" value="124 you two are friends... has she messaged you by chance?"/>
                            <keyword start="249589/5s" duration="7100/2500s" value="125 no, i mean i saw her before the exam but -"/>
                            <keyword start="1248016/25s" duration="10100/2500s" value="126 did she say anything? anything unusual, or strange?"/>
                            <keyword start="1248116/25s" duration="7800/2500s" value="127 you think this could be serious?"/>
                            <keyword start="249639/5s" duration="25600/2500s" value="128 we’re worried about her."/>
                            <keyword start="1249136/25s" duration="20300/2500s" value="117 i probably shouldn’t tell you this, but finn kelly was on school grounds earlier today."/>
                            <keyword start="1249336/25s" duration="7400/2500s" value="118 and what... you think he’s got something to do with olivia going missing?"/>
                            <keyword start="1249407/25s" duration="9900/2500s" value="119 no, no-one thinks that-- well, maybe her mother. "/>
                            <keyword start="1249506/25s" duration="10400/2500s" value="120 finn said olivia ran off after she saw him."/>
                            <keyword start="249922/5s" duration="4000/2500s" value="121 maybe she just got scared then. "/>
                            <keyword start="49986s" duration="13200/2500s" value="122 she’s missed a year twelve exam and her phone’s off. it’s very unlike her. "/>
                            <keyword start="1249751/25s" duration="3100/2500s" value="123 yashvi shifts, uncomfortable. "/>
                            <keyword start="1249782/25s" duration="6900/2500s" value="124 you two are friends... has she messaged you by chance?"/>
                            <keyword start="1249852/25s" duration="7100/2500s" value="125 no, i mean i saw her before the exam but -"/>
