                            <keyword start="1244812/25s" duration="9000/2500s" value="104 you got your uni preferences in on time?"/>
                            <keyword start="1244896/25s" duration="17700/2500s" value="105 yep - sports science at hawke, nursing at langton. and early childhood at eden hills."/>
                            <keyword start="1245068/25s" duration="11800/2500s" value="106 you’ve never mentioned early childhood in any of our careers sessions before."/>
                            <keyword start="1245188/25s" duration="16000/2500s" value="107 well, you know, it comes pretty easy to me. i spend a lot of time with my cousins. (beat) they’re small. "/>
                            <keyword start="1245763/25s" duration="6600/2500s" value="104 you got your uni preferences in on time?"/>
